{
  "id": "JHN.14",
  "number": "14",
  "bookId": "JHN",
  "reference": "John 14",
  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "14",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let not your heart be troubled: believe in God, believe also in me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In my Father’s house are many mansions; if it were not so, I would have told you; for I go to prepare a place for you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And if I go and prepare a place for you, I come again, and will receive you unto myself; that where I am, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ye may be also. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And whither I go, ye know the way. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thomas saith unto him, Lord, we know not whither thou goest; how know we the way? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus saith unto him, I am the way, and the truth, and the life: no one cometh unto the Father, but by me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If ye had known me, ye would have known my Father also: from henceforth ye know him, and have seen him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Philip saith unto him, Lord, show us the Father, and it sufficeth us. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus saith unto him, Have I been so long time with you, and dost thou not know me, Philip? he that hath seen me hath seen the Father; how sayest thou, Show us the Father? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Believest thou not that I am in the Father, and the Father in me? the words that I say unto you I speak not from myself: but the Father abiding in me doeth his works. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Believe me that I am in the Father, and the Father in me: or else believe me for the very works’ sake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Verily, verily, I say unto you, He that believeth on me, the works that I do shall he do also; and greater ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " than these shall he do; because I go unto the Father. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And whatsoever ye shall ask in my name, that will I do, that the Father may be glorified in the Son. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If ye shall ask anything in my name, that will I do. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If ye love me, ye will keep my commandments. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will pray the Father, and he shall give you another Comforter, that he may be with you for ever, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " the Spirit of truth: whom the world cannot receive; for it beholdeth him not, neither knoweth him: ye know him; for he abideth with you, and shall be in you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will not leave you desolate: I come unto you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yet a little while, and the world beholdeth me no more; but ye behold me: because I live, ye shall live also. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In that day ye shall know that I am in my Father, and ye in me, and I in you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He that hath my commandments, and keepeth them, he it is that loveth me: and he that loveth me shall be loved of my Father, and I will love him, and will manifest myself unto him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Judas (not Iscariot) saith unto him, Lord, what is come to pass that thou wilt manifest thyself unto us, and not unto the world? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus answered and said unto him, If a man love me, he will keep my word: and my Father will love him, and we will come unto him, and make our abode with him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He that loveth me not keepeth not my words: and the word which ye hear is not mine, but the Father’s who sent me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These things have I spoken unto you, while ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " abiding with you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the Comforter, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " the Holy Spirit, whom the Father will send in my name, he shall teach you all things, and bring to your remembrance all that I said unto you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Peace I leave with you; my peace I give unto you: not as the world giveth, give I unto you. Let not your heart be troubled, neither let it be fearful. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye heard how I said to you, I go away, and I come unto you. If ye loved me, ye would have rejoiced, because I go unto the Father: for the Father is greater than I. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And now I have told you before it come to pass, that, when it is come to pass, ye may believe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will no more speak much with you, for the prince of the world cometh: and he hath nothing in me; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but that the world may know that I love the Father, and as the Father gave me commandment, even so I do. Arise, let us go hence.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
